{"created": "2026-08-12T16:04:53.473601+00:00", "modified": "2026-08-12T16:04:53.748626+00:00", "id": 21906728, "conceptrecid": "21904762", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21906728", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21904762", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21906728", "metadata": {"title": "The Calculus of Re-Entrant Distinctions: A Unified Treatise on the Loop, the Tree, and the Constants of Self-Reference", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21906728", "publication_date": "2026-08-12", "description": "A unified treatise on the loop, the tree, and the constants of self-reference. The primitive act of distinction generates, under the discipline of re-entry and linear resource management, the constants e and pi, the completions of the rational numbers, the loop-tree duality of the Langlands program, the mathematical structure of quantum theory, and the grammar of a universal logical language. Forty sections spanning Spencer-Brown's Laws of Form, linear and differential linear logic, the emergence of e and pi as logical scalars, adelic geometry and Tate's thesis, the Langlands program as natural duality, the physics of the re-entrant mark (oscillator, Compton frequency, zitterbewegung, measurement, holography, black hole entropy), statistics (CLT, Poisson, maximum entropy, Levy-Khintchine), and traced differential cohesive linear homotopy type theory. Central thesis: the re-entrant mark, disciplined by linearity, differentiation, and tracing, is the generative grammar of the constants, the number system, and the physical laws. v0.5: corrected 2 accuracy findings from reviewer subagent audit (S8.1 DOI misattribution removed; S25.3 zitterbewegung amplitude corrected to standard lambda_C/2 with 4pi reframed as conjecture).", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Quni-Gudzinas, Rowan Brad", "affiliation": "QNFO", "orcid": "0009-0002-4317-5604"}], "keywords": ["laws of form", "spencer-brown", "linear logic", "differential linear logic", "adelic geometry", "langlands program", "homotopy type theory", "quantum foundations", "ostrowski theorem", "traced monoidal categories", "philosophy of physics", "foundations of quantum mechanics", "consilience", "philosophy of mathematics", "p-adic numbers", "ultrametric spaces", "geometry of interaction", "cohesive homotopy type theory", "ignorance audit", "epistemic hygiene"], "version": "v0.5", "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-nc-sa-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "qnfo"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 4, "is_last": false, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21904762"}}]}}, "title": "The Calculus of Re-Entrant Distinctions: A Unified Treatise on the Loop, the Tree, and the Constants of Self-Reference", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21906728", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21906728", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21906728?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21906728", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21906728", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21906728", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21906728/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21904762", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21904762", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21904762", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21904762", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21906728/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21906728/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21906728/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21906728/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21906728:reentrant-distinctions.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21906728:reentrant-distinctions.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21906728:re